  "body": "The previous statement, \"once per Document\", was slightly incorrect,\nsince module maps are actually associated with environment settings\nobjects. Environment settings objects are 1:1 with global objects (such\nas Windows and WorkerGlobalScopes), but Windows are not 1:1 with\nDocuments (due to document.open() and the initial about:blank).\n\nThe new phrasing retains the readability of the old one, by using\n\"Window or WorkerGlobalScope\" instead of just saying \"environment\nsettings object\", but it is more accurate.\n",
